config BATTERY_SAVER
	bool "Adaptive SDM845 Battery Saver and Power Optimization"
	depends on CPU_FREQ && HOTPLUG_CPU && SMP
	default n
	help
	  This built-in driver provides adaptive battery saving and thermal power
	  optimization for Qualcomm Snapdragon 845 (Xiaomi Poco F1 'beryllium').

	  It clamps peak CPU frequencies on both Little (Silver) and Big (Gold)
	  clusters, regulates Big cluster active core counts, and provides multiple
	  power profiles (Balanced, Extreme, Ultra, Custom).

	  It is linked directly into the kernel image, initializes at boot, and
	  exposes runtime controls through sysfs.

	  Enable this option with Y to include battery_saver in the kernel.
